    "detailed_description": "<strong>Combasters</strong> is an intense strategy game with elements of tower defense, Combasters are masters who will help you combine elements to win.<br><br>  Your mission is to protect the Christmas town from the advancing enemies. The key to victory lies in the skillful use of defensive turrets and units, which you create and upgrade through a unique item-crossing system. Collect trophies from defeated enemies, such as weapons and magical artifacts, and combine them to create new, powerful types of turrets. Every choice affects your strategy and the outcome of the battle, making &quot;Combasters&quot; an exciting challenge for fans of strategy and innovative gameplay.",
